sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Voter
    participant Client as Next.js Frontend
    participant API as /api/auth/login
    participant DB as Off-Chain Database

    Voter->>Client: Enter Email & Password
    Client->>API: POST /api/auth/login
    API->>DB: Lookup user by Email
    DB-->>API: User record (salt:hash)
    API->>API: Verify PBKDF2 hash
    API->>DB: Create session token
    API-->>Client: 200 OK (Set HTTP-Only Cookie)
    Client-->>Voter: Authenticated User Session Active
